{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55184","headline":"对仰山问作偈（题拟） · 智闲","name":"对仰山问作偈（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去年未是贫，今年始是贫。\n去年无卓锥之地，今年锥也无。\n（《五灯会元》卷九作：「去年贫未是贫，今年贫始是贫。\n去年贫犹有卓锥之地，今年贫，锥也无。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"智闲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55184.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55184","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}